{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["SPRIGGAN (ONA)","A great civilization once existed on this Earth. Possessing knowledge and scientific prowess far exceeding that of modern man, the relics of this ancient civilization remain hidden across this world even now. As high-speed communication networks cover the globe and the peering eyes of satellites are able to expose all secrets, the armies of great nations clash as they seek to uncover and research these artifacts, which possess an unfathomable “power.” A member of this ancient civilization carved a message into a plate: “Protect our relics from evil-doers.” Taking this message to heart, one organization aims to seal away this ancient civilization for good. The elite secret agents of this organization are known as…Spriggans.\n\n\n\n(Source: Netflix)"],"ja":["スプリガン (ONA)",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-39489","ids":{"shikimori":39489,"mal":39489,"anilist":108353,"kodik":"serial-43627"},"kodikIds":["serial-43609","serial-43576","serial-43627"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-43609":"2022-06-20T06:41:03Z","serial-43576":"2022-06-18T18:20:04Z","serial-43627":"2022-06-21T13:31:05Z"},"title":"Спригган ONA","originalTitle":"Spriggan (2022)","alt":"Spriggan (ONA) SPRIGGAN (ONA) スプリガン (ONA)","description":"В Турции у горы Арарат секретная организация «Аркам» обнаруживает объект, предположительно представляющий собой Ноев Ковчег. Разумеется, такая находка привлекает к себе внимание. Ковчегом не прочь завладеть и одна из подпольных организаций Пентагона США, и на пути у них стоит лишь спецотряд «Аркам», известный как «Спригган». Японский агент «Сприггана» Ю Оминаэ объединяется с французским агентом Жаном Жакмондо , чтобы противостоять американскому отряду под предводительством полковника МакДугалла — мальчика, который после генетического эксперимента приобрёл сверхъестественные способности. «Сприггану» нужно действовать слаженно и эффективно, дабы не дать МакДугаллу использовать Ковчег для достижения собственных целей.","year":2022,"type":"ONA","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Приключения","Фантастика","военное"],"rating":6.86,"popularity":18829,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/39489/d4238f2dc98d04c4b766a8d8d5589313.jpeg","width":424,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/108353-xmcJGLygTB0I.jpg","width":1900,"height":401}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-43609","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1017280/4697b3b41f0995f0c8ef041ee1b65e19/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1946","dubId":"1946","label":"Netflix.Subtitles","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-43576","translationId":"1946","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1016570/a8a6fc6a6b2fdab5199f8e24bcc4fb1e/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-43627","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1017596/435224018217bf210cb4a047c1cde27a/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-43609","translationId":"609","url":"htt